{"qid": "tt_t3_00002", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "legalgate", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 1.53, "n_tokens": 518, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "B", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.64, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 778, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "⚠️ 《合同法》已于 2021-01-01 被废止，现行规定见《民法典》。民法典施行同时废止合同法、物权法、侵权责任法、婚姻法、继承法、收养法、担保法\n\n【现行规定】《民法典》第一百四十三条：具备下列条件的民事法律行为有效：\n\n（来源：https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail2.html?ZmY4MDgxODE3Yjk3MDgxMDEzZGExNzVjYTlkYjQ2Mw==）\n\n【现行规定】《民法典》第一百五十三条：违反法律、行政法规的强制性规定的民事法律行为无效，但是该强制性规定不导致该民事法律行为无效的除外。违背公序良俗的民事法律行为无效。\n\n（来源：https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail2.html?ZmY4MDgxODE3Yjk3MDgxMDEzZGExNzVjYTlkYjQ2Mw==）\n\n【现行规定】《民法典》第一百五十七条：民事法律行为无效、被撤销或者确定不发生效力后，行为人因该行为取得的财产，应当予以返还；不能返还或者没有必要返还的，应当折价补偿。有过错的一方应当赔偿对方由此所受到的损失；各方都有过错的，应当各自承担相应的责任。法律另有规定的，依照其规定。\n\n（来源：https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail2.html?ZmY4MDgxODE3Yjk3MDgxMDEzZGExNzVjYTlkYjQ2Mw==）\n\n【现行规定】《民法典》第五百七十七条：当事人一方不履行合同义务或者履行合同义务不符合约定的，应当承担继续履行、采取补救措施或者赔偿损失等违约责任。\n\n（来源：https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail2.html?ZmY4MDgxODE3Yjk3MDgxMDEzZGExNzVjYTlkYjQ2Mw==）\n\n【法律沿革】合同法 → 民法典", "trace": {"channel": "B", "slots": {"law_short": "合同法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": null, "temporal_query": true, "law_validity_query": true, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}, "steps": ["law_validity_check"], "temporal": {"status": "已废止", "is_safe": false, "warning": "⚠️ 《合同法》已于 2021-01-01 被废止，现行规定见《民法典》。民法典施行同时废止合同法、物权法、侵权责任法、婚姻法、继承法、收养法、担保法", "replacement": {"law_short": "民法典", "note": "民法典施行同时废止合同法、物权法、侵权责任法、婚姻法、继承法、收养法、担保法", "relation": "废止"}, "chain": ["合同法", "民法典"], "as_of": "2026-11-01", "matched_law": "合同法"}, "validity_status": "已废止", "replacement": [{"law_short": "民法典", "article_no": 143, "note": "合同无效事由改由民法典第143、144、146、153、154条规定"}, {"law_short": "民法典", "article_no": 153, "note": "违反强制性规定、违背公序良俗的民事法律行为无效"}, {"law_short": "民法典", "article_no": 157, "note": "无效后的返还与折价补偿规则"}, {"law_short": "民法典", "article_no": 577, "note": "违约责任承担方式"}, {"law_short": "民法典", "article_no": 585, "note": "违约金的约定与司法调整"}, {"law_short": "民法典", "article_no": 667, "note": "借款合同定义"}, {"law_short": "民法典", "article_no": 680, "note": "自然人之间借款利息规则与禁止高利放贷"}], "u": null, "tau_b": null, "bucket": "b2", "slots_inherited": [], "decision": "route=B reason=law_validity", "latency_ms": 1.5, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "must_show_warning": true, "intent": {"hit_provision": true, "hit_case_no": false, "slots_complete": true, "route_b_reason": "law_validity", "slots": {"law_short": "合同法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": null, "temporal_query": true, "law_validity_query": true, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}}, "draft_source": "channel_b（未取草稿）", "draft_attempts": []}}
{"qid": "tt_t3_00008", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "legalgate", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 1134.46, "n_tokens": 210, "u": 0.428369, "tau_b": 1.0, "tau": null, "channel": "A", "gate_source": "neural_signal", "router_mode": "hybrid", "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.28, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 315, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "不能。自2021年1月1日《中华人民共和国民法典》施行之日起，《中华人民共和国侵权责任法》已同时废止（《民法典》第1260条明确列出废止的九部法律，其中包括《侵权责任法》）。\n\n因此：\n\n1. **起诉状中不应再引用《侵权责任法》**，否则属于援引已失效法律，可能被法院要求补正，也影响文书的专业性。\n\n2. **应改引《民法典》侵权责任编**（第七编\"侵权责任\"，第1164条至第1258条）。例如：\n   - 一般侵权责任：第1165条\n   - 过错推定：第1166条\n   - 无过错责任：第1167条（注：请以现行条文为准核对条号）\n   - 人身损害赔偿：第1179条\n   - 财产损失：第1184条\n   - 精神", "trace": {"channel": "A", "u": 0.428369, "u_signal": 0.428369, "u_complexity": 0.5, "gate_source": "neural_signal", "router_mode": "hybrid", "complexity_features": {"long": 0.0, "case_word": 0.0, "topic": 0.2, "multi_turn": 0.0, "compare": 0.1, "boilerplate_penalty": -0.0, "category_prior": 0.2}, "tau_b": 1.0, "bucket": "b2", "slots": {"law_short": "侵权责任法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": "侵权责任", "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}, "slots_inherited": [], "validity_status": null, "case_verify": null, "source_url": null, "decision": "[neural_signal] u=0.4284 <= tau_b2=1.0 → A", "latency_ms": 1134.4, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "signal": "margin", "k_draft": 20, "intent": {"hit_provision": false, "hit_case_no": false, "slots_complete": false, "route_b_reason": "", "slots": {"law_short": "侵权责任法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "cas